  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Do It Again** (1 review, 1 other source): Alan Evans sang vocals on the closer; Alan Evans handled vocals on this song [1][2]\n- **new song** (1 review): Reggie Watts sang vocals on the new song [2]\n- **Don't Tell** (1 review): Reggie Watts also provided vocals on this one [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **new song**: rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n- **Don't Tell**: rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2006-06-18.adktl.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 93 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Scheduled for a 10 pm start on 6-17, it actually began near midnight and ran until about 2 am on 6-18 [4]\n- A late-night show announced the day before, billed as an after party for the Indy Jazz Festival [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2006-06-18.adktl.flac16**: taped by Shawn Smith; transferred by Shawn Smith; source: ADK A51-TL (cards/DIN)> UA-5 (bm2+ mod) > JB3 (optical in @ 44.1 khz) [1]. Also: The two discs can be joined seamlessly [1]",
